1
00:00:00,141 --> 00:00:02,971
(Raj:)In case you didn't follow that,
I'm the coffee.

2
00:00:04,645 --> 00:00:08,305
Leonard, maybe you'd like to go
with them to meet girls.

3
00:00:08,482 --> 00:00:10,472
(Leonard:)Why would I be interested?
I have Penny.

4
00:00:10,651 --> 00:00:12,621
(Sheldon:)Yeah, for now.

5
00:00:13,654 --> 00:00:16,084
(Sheldon:)But that woman has a death wish,
Leonard.

6
00:00:16,257 --> 00:00:20,287
Yeah, she talks to strangers,
she pets unfamiliar dogs...

7
00:00:20,461 --> 00:00:25,231
(Sheldon:)...and it is ridiculously easy
to break into her apartment.

8
00:00:25,766 --> 00:00:28,326
(Sheldon:)If I were you, I'd get a backup.

9
00:00:28,502 --> 00:00:32,772
(Leonard:)You can't just replace someone you care
about with some other random person.

10
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,570
Uh, please don't ruin this for me.

11
00:00:37,745 --> 00:00:40,175
(Sheldon:)Do you remember how upset I was...

12
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:42,941
(Sheldon:)...when they replaced
Edward Norton as the Hulk?

13
00:00:43,117 --> 00:00:45,247
(Leonard:)Yes, you walked around for a week...

14
00:00:45,419 --> 00:00:48,509
(Leonard:)...saying,
"Sheldon unhappy with casting choice."

15
00:00:50,191 --> 00:00:55,651
(Sheldon:)But then Mark Ruffalo was the Hulk
in The Avengers and he was even better.

16
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:58,320
- What's your point?
- Call me a romantic.

17
00:00:58,499 --> 00:01:05,029
(Sheldon:)I like to think that your Mark Ruffalo
is still out there somewhere.

